<title>UK: Credit Local adds 100 billion lire to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local adds 100 billion lire to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano, Banque Nationale de Paris and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT   *400 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    05.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.805    PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINAL 300 BLN LIRE LAUNCHED 13.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	PLUS 29 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>		FUNGIBLE AFTER 40 DAYS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
